<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Novocherkassk</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Novocherkassk is a city in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rostov">Rostov</a> oblast, southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>, founded in 1805 by Ataman <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/matvei-platov">Matvei Platov</a> as the new capital of the Don <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cossacks">Cossack</a> Host. It was a centre of the anti-Bolshevik Don Cossacks in the Russian Civil War, and in 1962 a workers' protest there was put down with gunfire by Soviet troops, the Novocherkassk massacre. Its large Ascension Cathedral was completed in 1905.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/novocherkassk.jpg" alt="Novocherkassk" width="320" height="251" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Denis Putilin at English Wikipedia · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Novoch_Triumph_arc.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
